# AI Chatbot

## Description
This project is an AI Chatbot developed to answer user queries intelligently. It provides interactive conversations and demonstrates the use of AI concepts to build a simple chatbot application.

## How to Run

1. Clone the repository:
   ```bash
   git clone https://github.com/dhanvigk-afk/DecodeLabs-Internship.git
   ```

2. Open the project folder:
   ```bash
   cd DecodeLabs-Internship
   ```

3. Run the project according to your programming language or framework.
